  "content": "```html\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">花朵偽裝者是為 SpookyJam 2023 製作的模組，高度可自訂。預設情況下，每當玩家在夜晚走動時，任何花朵都可能變成偽裝者並變身成一隻生物。發生時會出現閃電，偽裝者會有自訂名稱。當玩家擊殺偽裝者時，會掉落額外物品和經驗值，而花朵會回到原本的位置。花朵成為偽裝者的機率為 <strong>1/50</strong>。<br><br><strong>可能造成驚嚇！<span style=\"font-size:18px\">👻</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br>雖然有預設值以提供即時體驗，但您可以更改許多行為：哪些花朵可以變成偽裝者、掉落的物品，以及偽裝者出現的時機與條件等多種設定。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>flowerIsMimicChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.02，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">花朵遇到玩家時變成偽裝者並變身成生物的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraExperienceOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擊殺偽裝者時額外掉落的經驗值數量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropExtraItemsOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在擊殺偽裝者時掉落 ./config/flowermimics/.. 中指定的物品。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyTransformMimicsAtNight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">花朵是否只在夜晚變身成生物。若關閉，則隨時都能變身。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>resetMimicsBeforeNightTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在白天轉為夜晚時重置花朵偽裝者的可能性。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">偽裝者生成時是否移除原本的花朵方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropFlowerItemOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">偽裝者死亡時是否掉落花朵物品。必須啟用「removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn」。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceOriginalFlowerBlockOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">偽裝者死亡時是否放回原本的花朵方塊。必須啟用「removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn」。目標位置需為空氣方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>placeFlowerBlockWhereMimicDies</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在偽裝者死亡的位置放置花朵方塊。必須啟用「removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn」。目標位置需為空氣方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showLightningOnMimicSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">偽裝者生成時是否顯示閃電。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showLightningOnFlowerBlockReturn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">花朵方塊被重新放置到世界中時是否顯示閃電。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventMimicsOnPlacedAndBoneMealFlowers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">手動放置或使用骨粉催熟的花朵是否不會生成偽裝者。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForMimicAroundBlockRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 15，最小值 1，最大值 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組檢查玩家周圍多遠範圍內的花朵偽裝者。增加此數值會消耗更多處理效能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mimicTransformAroundPlayerRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 5，最小值 1，最大值 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家距離偽裝者花朵多近時，花朵才會變身。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForMimicFlowersDelayInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 50，最小值 1，最大值 3600000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組檢查玩家周圍花朵偽裝者的頻率（以刻為單位）。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，在 <em><strong>./config/flowermimics/. </strong></em>目錄中有兩個設定檔：</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以設定花朵偽裝者會變成什麼生物，也適用於模組的生物與花朵：</span></strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_mimics.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以更改花朵偽裝者掉落的物品：</span></strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_item_drops.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在夜晚走動時要小心！花朵可能不只是花朵：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設情況下，擊殺偽裝者後它會放回原本的花朵，並掉落額外物品和經驗值：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多模組頁面上逐一追蹤留言，因此留言功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>\n```",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
